{"title":"Markets in everything?","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/934855568/0/marginalrevolution~Markets-in-everything.html","date":1765827348000,"content":"<blockquote><p>If you don’t yet have a REAL ID, you can continue to fly, but it’s going to cost you. Beginning Feb. 1, 2026, the Transportation Security Administration (TSA) will start collecting a $45 fee from travelers using non-compliant forms of identification at airport security checkpoints.</p>\r\n<p>The agency previously proposed a fee of $18 to cover the administrative and IT costs of ID verification for those traveling without a REAL ID or passport but increased the total to $45 <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://abcnews.go.com/US/tsa-announces-45-fee-travelers-real-id/story?id=127991193\" target=\"_blank\">in an announcement</a> released earlier this month.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://lifehacker.com/travel/flying-without-a-real-id-payment-required\" target=\"_blank\">the full story</a>, via the excellent <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/samirvarma\" target=\"_blank\">Samir Varma</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/12/markets-in-everything-75.html\">Markets in everything?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/934855568/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/934855568/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/934855568/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /><